"t01" [shape=box style=rounded label="1. DBCC to DBM: Fiscal program: revenue,\nspending ceiling, deficit, borrowing" tooltip="03a-01"]
"t02" [shape=box style=rounded label="2. DBM to National agency: Budget Call\n(National Budget Memorandum No. 156): policy,\nbudget levels, forms, calendar. Budget Forum\n28-29 January 2026" tooltip="03a-02"]
"t03" [shape=box style=rounded label="3. DBM to National agency: Forward Estimates\nfor FY 2027-2029, formulated by DBM with the\nagency (basis of Tier 1)" tooltip="03a-03"]
"t04" [shape=box style=rounded label="4. National agency to Operating units:\nInternal call for proposals" tooltip="03a-04"]
"tau1" [shape=box width=0.15 height=0.15 style=filled fillcolor="#444444" label="" tooltip="parallel split"]
"tau2" [shape=box width=0.15 height=0.15 style=filled fillcolor="#444444" label="" tooltip="parallel join"]
"t05" [shape=box style=rounded label="5. Operating units to Regional Development\nCouncils: Regional proposals for priority\nprograms and projects" tooltip="03a-05"]
"t06" [shape=box style=rounded label="6. Regional Development Councils to National\nagency: Inputs and recommendations (BP Form\nC). DEPDev regional offices send consolidated\nRDC resolutions to DBM" tooltip="03a-06"]
"t07" [shape=box style=rounded label="7. National agency to Civil society:\nConsultation on proposed programs" tooltip="03a-07"]
"t08" [shape=box style=rounded label="8. Civil society to National agency: Inputs\n(reported in BP Form D)" tooltip="03a-08"]
"t09" [shape=box style=rounded label="9. National agency to OSBPS: TIER 1: cost of\nongoing programs and commitments at the same\nscope and quality (BP Forms 201-A to 201-D,\n204, 205, 100 series, A and B). Submission\nperiod 6 March to 28 April 2026" tooltip="03a-09"]
"t10" [shape=box style=rounded label="10. National agency to OSBPS: TIER 2: new or\nexpanded programs and projects (BP Form 202,\nand 203 for foreign-assisted projects),\nimplementation-ready and endorsed" tooltip="03a-10"]
"t11" [shape=box style=rounded label="11. National agency to DBM: Two printed\ncopies. The electronic copy prevails" tooltip="03a-11"]
"t12" [shape=box style=rounded label="12. OSBPS to DBM: Encoded proposals" tooltip="03a-12"]
"t13" [shape=box style=rounded label="13. DBM to National agency: Technical budget\nhearings: the agency justifies its proposal" tooltip="03a-13"]
"t14" [shape=box style=rounded label="14. DBM: Evaluation and executive review. Tier\n2 proposals compete for the fiscal space\n(spending program minus total Tier 1)" tooltip="03a-14"]
"t15" [shape=box style=rounded label="15. DBM to DBCC: Proposed budget levels" tooltip="03a-15"]
"t16" [shape=box style=rounded label="16. DBCC to Cabinet: Recommended budget" tooltip="03a-16"]
"t17" [shape=box style=rounded label="17. Cabinet to DBM: Approval by the President\nand the Cabinet" tooltip="03a-17"]
"t18" [shape=box style=rounded label="18. DBM: Prepare the budget documents:\nNational Expenditure Program (NEP), Budget of\nExpenditures and Sources of Financing (BESF),\nPresident's Budget Message, staffing summary" tooltip="03a-18"]
"t19" [shape=box style=rounded label="19. Cabinet to Congress: Submit the budget\nwithin 30 days from the opening of the regular\nsession (for FY 2027: by 26 August 2026. Press\nreports: submitted on 11 August 2026)" tooltip="03a-19"]
